※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4689 LANG_TYPE_ARGUMENT_NOT_GENERIC

※ A type handed as an argument settles a type parameter; around a type that is
※ written down it settles nothing.

fn zero(kind: ⌜u8⌝) → u8:
    0u8

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    if zero(⌜u8⌝) = 0u8: 0u6 else: 1u6
